 "remarks": "Welcome to 25 Grand Street #112 in the highly desirable Clocktower Close condominium community in the heart of Norwalk. This beautifully fully renovated residence offers the perfect combination of modern finishes, comfort, and convenience. Step inside to discover an open and inviting floor plan featuring brand-new luxury flooring, fresh paint throughout, stylish new lighting fixtures, and a completely remodeled kitchen showcasing new cabinetry, elegant quartz countertops, and stainless steel appliances. Both bathrooms have been tastefully updated with new vanities and contemporary finishes, creating a move-in-ready home with a clean, modern aesthetic. Clocktower Close offers an exceptional lifestyle with outstanding amenities, including a fitness center, sauna, community room, and beautifully maintained grounds. Conveniently located just minutes from the South Norwalk (SoNo) train station, I-95, Route 7, the Merritt Parkway, shopping, restaurants, the Norwalk waterfront, and all that vibrant SoNo has to offer, this location is ideal for commuters and those looking to enjoy everything Norwalk has to offer. Don't miss this opportunity to lease a completely renovated home in one of Norwalk's most sought-after condominium communities!",
